  "body": "[DataTransferItem](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#datatransferitem) defines *the disabled mode* but the definitions for [`getAsString(callback)`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#dom-datatransferitem-getasstring) and [`getAsFile()`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#dom-datatransferitem-getasfile) doesn't check this state. As far as I read the spec, the intent here is for these functions to abort steps but that should be explicitly stated in the spec.",
